	(footprint "fm-radio-footprint-lib:ADF4351_LFCSP-32_5x5mm_P0.5mm_EP3.1x3.1mm"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "5855111b-fd0d-401f-b08f-17f5eba520ec")
		(at 92.88 50.005)
		(descr "Analog Devices ADF4351 wideband synthesiser, 32-lead LFCSP 5x5 mm, 0.75 mm height, package option CP-32-7 (ADF4351 Rev. A datasheet, Figure 40). Land pattern per the PCB Design Guidelines for a Chip Scale Package section, page 26: pads are 0.10 mm longer and 0.05 mm wider than the package lands, giving 0.50 x 0.30 mm pads on a 0.50 mm pitch, each centred on its land. Exposed pad 3.10 mm SQ (nominal), must be connected to GND. Thermal pad to inner pad edge clearance is 0.50 mm (AD minimum 0.25 mm). Nine thermal vias on the AD-specified 1.2 mm pitch grid, 0.30 mm drill / 0.60 mm pad, matching the project via rule. Vias must be plugged/plated per the datasheet to stop solder wicking. Paste is window-paned 3x3 at ~64% coverage of the exposed pad. Pin 1 is top-left, numbering counter-clockwise viewed from top.")
